1 REM FBCS SEG-0627
2 REM CLAIM A-9.2.2-TR164
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 4.4.2 l.1468-1474: an internal SUB of the main and an external PICTURE of the same name are different
5 REM routines: CALL runs the SUB, DRAW the picture.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE Q
20 SUB Q
30 PRINT "SUB-M"
40 END SUB
50 CALL Q
60 DRAW Q
90 END
200 EXTERNAL PICTURE Q
210 PRINT "PIC-EXT"
220 END PICTURE
